: WITNESS] The pulse finds the memory inside the threat before blades meet.":"[접근: 증언] 칼날이 닿기 전, 파동이 위협 안의 기억을 찾아낸다.","[BATTLE GRADE] %s +%d Grains.":"[전투 등급] %s +%d 그레인.","[CHOICE ECHO] Arrel keeps the song intact. The first enemy blow is guarded.":"[선택의 메아리] 아렐이 노래를 온전히 지킨다. 적의 첫 일격이 막힌다.","[CHOICE ECHO] The burned song scatters through the ash. Limit +18, BREAK pressure +22.":"[선택의 메아리] 태워진 노래가 잿더미로 흩어진다. 리밋 +18, BREAK 압력 +22.","[CODEX BONUS] Tactical record +%d Grains.":"[도감 보너스] 전술 기록 +%d 그레인.","[DIRECTIVE CHAIN] x%d +%d Grains.":"[전술 연속 달성] x%d +%d 그레인.","[NG+++] %s radiates with accumulated void energy!":"[NG+++] %s이(가) 축적된 보이드 기운을 발산한다!","[OBJECTIVE BONUS] %s +%d Grains.":"[목표 보너스] %s +%d 그레인.","[OBJECTIVE BONUS] Restored %d extra HP.":"[목표 보너스] HP %d 추가 회복.","[OBJECTIVE COMPLETE] %s":"[목표 달성] %s","[OBJECTIVE LOST] %s":"[목표 실패] %s","[OBJECTIVE] %s - %s":"[목표] %s - %s","[PRESERVATION] +%d Grains%s":"[보존] +%d 그레인%s","[RESONANCE BONUS] %s +%d Grains.":"[공명 보너스] %s +%d 그레인.","[RESONANCE] %s +%d":"[공명] %s +%d","[RESONANCE] %s state reached. Damage momentum rises.":"[공명] %s 상태 도달. 피해 기세가 오른다.","[TACTIC] %s%s":"[전술] %s%s","[TERRAIN] %s, %s":"[지형] %s, %s","[VOID CORRUPTION] %s":"[보이드 부패] %s"}},"min_steps":60,"modifiers":{"early":[],"extreme":[{"desc":"Reality fractures, the enemy becomes a Void Beast.","effect":"void_convert","id":"reality_tear","name":"Reality Tear","value":0},{"desc":"Echoes cascade, memory burns trigger double echoes.","effect":"double_echo","id":"echo_overload","name":"Echo Overload","value":0},{"desc":"The Bureau observes. End the fight in 6 turns.","effect":"turn_limit","id":"the_watcher","name":"The Watcher","value":6},{"desc":"BL-07 reaches for you. Lose HP each turn.","effect":"player_dot","id":"void_hunger","name":"Void Hunger","value":8}],"high":[{"desc":"Dark energy surges, enemies gain new abilities.","effect":"enemy_ability_add","id":"void_surge","name":"Void Surge","value":1},{"desc":"Time fractures. The enemy acts twice every 3rd rou